","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107671#pullrequestreview-3048956128","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107671","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-07-23T20:34:13Z"},{"id":3049018534,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc61vFSm","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected. Code looks good to me.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test_pr_107671.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21395023/test_pr_107671.zip)\r\n*This project contains an editor plugin that implements [\"play from position\" functionality](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12658).*\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/803c771b-dc66-4677-bece-1621b0c340c1\r\n\r\nNote that one limitation with this approach is that arguments are always appended at the end, with no way to control the order between plugins. This can have an importance if you're passing user command line arguments (i.e. `--engine-arg -- --user-arg`), as anything after `--` will be ignored by the engine itself and treated as an user argument.\r\n\r\nHaving support for specifying user command line arguments in a way that isn't reliant on order (e.g. `+user-arg`) could help resolve this in the long run.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107671#pullrequestreview-3049018534","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107671","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-07-23T20:47:25Z"},{"id":3052386001,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6177bR","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","login":"dsnopek","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107671#pullrequestreview-3052386001","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107671","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-07-24T16:31:58Z"},{"id":3052387884,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc61774s","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","login":"dsnopek","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107671#pullrequestreview-3052387884","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107671","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-07-24T16:32:41Z"},{"id":3052544686,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc618iKu","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?u